{
  "$comment": "Canonical action catalog for Signal Box. Risk belongs to the ACTION, never to the skill, since one skill routinely spans L1 reads and L4 financial writes. adapter is what a real deployment would need; 'sandbox' means the v7 corpus holds no credential that could perform it (see registry/README.md).",
